  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $294.04B (+0.8% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOYUUyZzBReEpiOHdwYUFqREJuVGVFcUdVNjBnUkNOalpIMXE4b0pBV0swSW5GekFQRl9sNTRGWW05RV8xN2tPNUIzbEpoMFdBZGJUM3VvdDRPZkVQNjhCcXlLcEwxdHBEcURyUDhZNzU3QjRlQWg0U2xUc3dIRXNZNEFqdnVXQ1FlUF9RWE1oNEtuUGRoempiYUl4WkVxNEJzU3psWEhRQ1JSeGUzZVhCMDJqb0FFUHZJUU95bTRDUUkxel9tekNTM0Rfakg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New stablecoin Open USD goes live as Coinbase, Mastercard, Stripe and Visa commit $1 billion to liquidity</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-01-hyperliquid-circle-mica-review-417452\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyperliquid Policy Center, Circle press EU on perps and stablecoin reserves in MiCA review</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/deals/2026-10-01-evernorth-xrpn-nasdaq-armada-shareholders-approve-417413\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evernorth shareholders approve $1 billion XRP treasury deal, clearing path to Nasdaq debut</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
